<header class="masthead">
  <h1>Too many entries</h1>
</header>

<section>
  <p class="empty">
    Several entries have already arrived from this connection, so this one was
    not sent and nothing has been stored. Try again in about {@minutes} {if @minutes == 1,
      do: "minute",
      else: "minutes"}.
  </p>

  <p class="footnote">
    A shared connection counts as one: a club, a school or a venue's wifi all
    look the same from here. If a group is entering together, leave a few
    minutes between entries, or send the list to the organisers instead.
  </p>

  <p><a href={@back}>Back</a></p>
</section>
